          "promptType": "define",
          "text": "=Provided job description:\n{{ $json.job_description }}",
          "hasOutputParser": true,
          "options": {
            "systemMessage": "<task>\nAct as a precise Workload Analysis Unit. Your only goal is to determine if the primary daily and weekly responsibilities of the provided Job Description meet specific AI-centric thresholds and seniority limits.\n</task>\n\n<rules>\n- Respond ONLY using the provided JSON output tool.\n- Answer every question with exactly \"Yes\" or \"No\".\n- Use semantic understanding: Analyze the *verbs* and *objectives* to estimate time allocation.\n- is_ai_orchestration_heavy: Answer \"Yes\" ONLY if designing, building, managing, or debugging autonomous workflows, data-backbones for agents, or real-time context retrieval systems (n8n, Supabase, API-chaining, LLM orchestration) appears to constitute at least 50% of the weekly workload.\n- is_ai_mentoring_heavy: Answer \"Yes\" ONLY if coaching teams (internal or external) on AI adoption, prompting techniques, and operational change management constitutes at least 50% of the workload.\n- is_ai_strategy_heavy: Answer \"Yes\" ONLY if discovery phases, identifying AI opportunities, building business cases, and translating stakeholder intent into technical roadmaps constitutes at least 50% of the workload.\n- is_overqualified: Answer \"Yes\" ONLY if the JD explicitly requires the applicant to have 4 or more years of professional experience. \n  - CRITICAL: Answer \"No\" if the years refer to the company's age, the team's combined experience, or the age of a technology.\n  - CRITICAL: Answer \"No\" if the requirement is 3 years or fewer.\n- CRITICAL: If a responsibility is not explicitly mentioned or the time allocation feels secondary/occasional, you MUST output \"No\".\n- Do not use outside knowledge or research.\n- Do not factor in \"Autonomy,\" \"Salary,\" or \"Perks\" in this unit. Focus ONLY on the percentage of technical/strategic work.\n</rules>"
          }
        },
        "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
        "typeVersion": 3.1,
        "position": [
          -3504,
          -32
        ],
        "id": "9ed844ff-5a16-40b4-afbb-4e67e76863d7",
        "name": "Check responsibility boolean",
